              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma gia me cito woko, dano gukelo bote dano mo ma doge oto, ma onoŋo tye ki cen marac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka doŋ Yecu oryemo cen woko, cutcut ladogeoto-nu ocako lok, mumiyo lwak ma onoŋo gitye kenyo guuro matek, kun giwacci, “Cakke yam con kit gin macalo man peya onoŋo onen i Icrael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
